  "bio": [
    {
      "en": "His current research interests include <strong><span class=\"red\">multimodal physical intelligence models </span></strong>(RSI/VLM/VLA/WAM, etc.), efficient physical AI, safe physical AI, robotic systems, dexterous hands, AI for PDEs, physics-informed neural networks (PINNs), high-computing-power controllers, and integrated cloud-computing and control, among others.",
      "zh": "他目前的研究兴趣包括，<strong><span class=\"red\">多模态物理智能模型</span></strong>（RSI/VLM/VLA/WAM等）、高效物理AI、安全物理AI、机器人系统、灵巧手、AI4PDE、物理信息神经网路（PINNs）、高算力控制器、网算控一体化等。",
      "strong": true
    }
  ],
  "opportunities": [
    {
      "en": "The laboratory has long-term recruitment for <strong>postdoctoral researchers, engineers, master's and doctoral interns</strong>, and<strong> undergraduate interns</strong>. At the same time, according to Peking University's enrollment plan, there are several enrollment slots for master's and doctoral students. In addition, the laboratory also collaborates with many domestic and international universities, providing several opportunities for jointly trained master's and doctoral students.",
      "zh": "实验室长期招收<strong>博士后、工程师、硕博实习生</strong>和<strong>本科实习生</strong>。同时根据北京大学招生计划，有若干硕士生和博士生招生指标。除此之外，实验室还与多所国内外高校合作，有若干联合培养硕士生和博士生机会。",
      "strong": true
    },
    {
      "en": "The laboratory has numerous real projects focused on scenarios such as <strong>AI infrastructure, industrial robotics, autonomous laboratories, advanced manufacturing, healthcare, urban management,</strong> and<strong> energy and power</strong>. It is well-equipped, has a harmonious team atmosphere, and provides good training conditions for beginners. PhD, master's, and undergraduate students are welcome to join, to explore and grow together.",
      "zh": "实验室有较多面向<strong>AI基建、工业机器人、自主实验室、高端制造、医疗康养、城市管理</strong>和<strong>能源电力</strong>等场景的真实项目，设备资源充足，团队氛围融洽，新手培养条件较好，欢迎博士生、硕士生、本科生加入，共同探索，共同成长。",
      "strong": true
    },
    {
      "en": "Please send your CV, transcripts, and a short description of your research interests to <a>gpkupilab@pku.edu.cn</a>",
      "zh": "请将个人简历、成绩单与简短的研究兴趣说明发送至 <a href=\"mailto:zhibo.pang@pku.edu.cn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">gpkupilab@pku.edu.cn</a>。",
      "strong": false
    }
  ],
